    {
      "text": "Risk of bias and applicability concerns chart (QUADAS-2) for Xpert MTB/XDR isoniazid-resistance studies (Figure 4), rating Cepheid 2020, DIAMA 2020 and FIND 2020 across patient selection, index test, reference standard and flow and timing. Nearly all ratings are low; Cepheid 2020 is unclear for patient selection and DIAMA 2020 is high for flow and timing. Key: red = high, yellow '?' = unclear, green = low.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
